	(text "Address = 0100 A2 A1 A0 (typical, check).\nU1: A2 A1 A0 = GND GND GND, 0x20.  U2: GND GND +3V3, 0x21.\nPad 1 of each jumper is bridged by a trace.\nCut it and bridge pad 3 to change the address.\nA PCA9554A has base 0x38: the software must then use 0x38, 0x39."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 124.46 0)
		(effects
