	(text "R1, R2 not fitted. The Pi has 1.8 kOhm pull-ups\non GPIO 2 and 3: a low line sinks 1.83 mA, under\nthe 3 mA limit. 4.7 kOhm more would give 2.54 mA.\nEvery chip on the bus runs from +3V3."
