	(text "Not fitted. Separate bus on GPIO 0 and 1, address 0x50.\nJP11 open: R82 holds WP high, the chip is write-protected.\nClose JP11 to write. Values from the HAT design guide:\nR80, R81 3.9 kOhm, R82 1 kOhm (to verify)."
